codex
The fused dim=384 projection is not competitive; it loses too much GEMM efficiency. I’m switching to tuning the existing dim=384 pipeline instead: layernorm row blocking and the projection postprocess transpose/gating kernel are simpler knobs and less likely to hurt correctness.
